30,000 structured vectors, 500 held-out queries; share of queries whose true
r-th nearest neighbour is somewhere in the index's top 10

  index                  recall@10   r=1   r=2   r=3   r=5   r=8  r=10
  M=4, ef_search=10          35.6%   41%   44%   37%   38%   32%   28%
  M=8, ef_search=10          63.9%   76%   75%   67%   66%   61%   54%
  M=16, ef_search=10         82.1%   90%   90%   86%   83%   76%   76%
  M=16, ef_search=40         98.7%  100%  100%   99%   99%   99%   98%

M=4, ef_search=10 missed the true best for 296 of 500 queries.
Its first result was then at true rank 4 in the median case,
and outside the true top 10 for 16% of them.
